# Flotsam Project Conventions

Flotsam is a Lit 3 Web Component library using `@pwrs/cem` for analysis and dev server. Follow these conventions derived from the Felt element library (zeroedin/felt).

## Project Structure

```
elements/
  flotsam-<name>/
    flotsam-<name>.ts        # Component class
    flotsam-<name>.css        # Shadow DOM styles
    demo/
      index.html              # Primary demo
      <variant>.html          # Additional demos
.config/
  cem.yaml                    # CEM analyzer + dev server config
  import-map.json             # Path alias overrides
styles/
  flotsam.css                 # Aggregated design tokens (base + theme)
```

## Naming

- Tag names: `flotsam-<name>` (e.g. `flotsam-card`, `flotsam-tooltip`)
- Class names: `Flotsam<Name>` (e.g. `FlotsamCard`, `FlotsamTooltip`)
- Package scope: `@flotsam/elements`
- Import paths: `@flotsam/elements/flotsam-<name>/flotsam-<name>.js`
- CSS token prefix: `--flotsam-`
- Internal/private CSS custom properties: `--_` prefix (no namespace)

## Workflow

- `npm start` — launch CEM dev server with import map and demo discovery
- `npm run analyze` — regenerate `custom-elements.json`
- Never import from barrel/index files; always import the specific element module
- Each element is self-contained in its own directory
- Controllers and utilities that are element-specific live alongside the element
